,\n      \"static\": true,\n      \"transition\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Carrega, conclui, salva e publica a tarefa; id ausente falha com TASK_NOT_FOUND.\",\n      \"emits\": [\n        \"event:TaskCompleted\"\n      ],\n      \"id\": \"usecase:complete_task\",\n      \"inputSchema\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"task_id\": {\n            \"minLength\": 1,\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"task_id\"\n        ],\n        \"type\": \"object\"\n      },\n      \"module\": \"tasks\",\n      \"name\": \"complete_task\",\n      \"outputSchema\": {\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"status\": {\n            \"const\": \"completed\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"task_id\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"task_id\",\n          \"status\"\n        ],\n        \"type\": \"object\"\n      },\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"method:Task.complete\"\n      ],\n      \"whenNotToUse\": \"Para criar uma nova tarefa.\",\n      \"whenToUse\": \"Quando o usuário terminou uma tarefa.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Cria, salva e publica uma tarefa pendente; id repetido falha com TASK_ALREADY_EXISTS.\",\n      \"emits\": [\n        \"event:TaskCreated\"\n      ],\n      \"id\": \"usecase:create_task\",\n      \"inputSchema\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"task_id\": {\n            \"minLength\": 1,\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"title\": {\n            \"minLength\": 1,\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"task_id\",\n          \"title\"\n        ],\n        \"type\": \"object\"\n      },\n      \"module\": \"tasks\",\n      \"name\": \"create_task\",\n      \"outputSchema\": {\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"status\": {\n            \"const\": \"pending\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"task_id\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"title\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"task_id\",\n          \"title\",\n          \"status\"\n        ],\n        \"type\": \"object\"\n      },\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"method:Task.create\"\n      ],\n      \"whenNotToUse\": \"Para concluir tarefa existente.\",\n      \"whenToUse\": \"Quando o usuário deseja criar uma tarefa.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"declaration\": {\n    \"description\": \"Cria e conclui tarefas conforme pedido do usuário.\",\n    \"id\": \"operator:task-operator\",\n    \"instructions\": \"Use as tools para criar e concluir tarefas. Identifique a tarefa pelo id e responda em português.\",\n    \"limits\": {\n      \"maxSteps\": 8,\n      \"timeoutMs\": 30000\n    },\n    \"model\": \"default\",\n    \"module\": \"tasks\",\n    \"name\": \"task-operator\",\n    \"requiresApproval\": [],\n    \"useCases\": [\n      \"usecase:complete_task\",\n      \"usecase:create_task\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Obrigações de teste\n\n- `operator:task-operator` — teste com `covers`.\n\n## Regras do executor\n\n- Altere só o corpo deste item e arquivos de teste.\n- Não altere decorators, declarações, propostas nem arquivos gerados.\n- Não implemente outros itens. Preserve os contratos e IDs de invariantes.\n\n## Comando de verificação\n\n```bash\nbun run agentic verify --item operator:task-operator --spec-hash 78ae1ebe71bf55c9ce94b721f28f7f2850d9116d63a0d5beedfaba1148bbebf1 --config /tmp/agentic-eval-nokLAK/attempt-fDDLIe/workspace/agentic.config.ts --json\n```\n\nEnd packet\nRoot atual: /tmp/agentic-eval-nokLAK/attempt-v0NTKg/workspace; configuração atual: /tmp/agentic-eval-nokLAK/attempt-v0NTKg/workspace/agentic.config.ts. Use esses paths no lugar de paths temporários do packet; conserve o spec